From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:33:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] feat: nest agent-opened child threads under their
 opener in the sidebar

Ports the server side of pingdotgg/t3code#16699 (openedByThreadId on
t3_thread_launch and create_threads) and renders families like Claude.app:
a child nests under its opener only within the same inbox section, with a
guide line, context-menu collapse and a summary stub.
